.Dd $Mdocdate: October 6 2026 $
.Dt UNCM 4
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm uncm
.Nd USB Network Control Model
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Cd "uncm*  at uhub?"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
driver provides support for USB Network Control Model (NCM) devices,
commonly used for USB tethering.
.Pp
.Nm
should work with devices that provide USB tethering via NCM,
such as most Android devices.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr intro 4 ,
.Xr netintro 4 ,
.Xr umb 4 ,
.Xr usb 4 ,
.Xr hostname.if 5 ,
.Xr ifconfig 8
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm
device driver first appeared in
.Ox 8.1 .
.Sh AUTHORS
.An -nosplit
The
.Nm
driver was written by
.An Jan Schreiber Aq Mt jes@posteo.de
and is based on the
.Xr umb 4
driver.
